											String io_k8s_api_admissionregistration_v1beta1_MutatingAdmissionPolicyBindingList_items_spec_paramRef_namespace {doc 'namespace is the namespace of the referenced resource Allows limiting the search for params to a specific namespace Applies to both name and selector fieldsA per-namespace parameter may be used by specifying a namespace-scoped paramKind in the policy and leaving this field empty- If paramKind is cluster-scoped, this field MUST be unset Setting this field results in a configuration error- If paramKind is namespace-scoped, the namespace of the object being evaluated for admission will be used when this field is left unset Take care that if this is left empty the binding must not match any cluster-scoped resources, which will result in an error'}
