											String io_k8s_api_admissionregistration_v1beta1_MutatingAdmissionPolicyList_items_metadata_annotations_ValueMap {doc 'value: Added Map for complete structure Object in the model The modified is not in json but provide represents, Array of pairs key, value: ValueMap, KeyMap'}
									io_k8s_api_admissionregistration_v1beta1_MutatingAdmissionPolicyList_items_metadata_creationTimestamp {doc 'CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations Clients may not set this value It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTCPopulated by the system Read-only Null for lists More info: https:_gitk8sio/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventionsmd#metadata'}
