																	String io_k8s_api_apps_v1_DaemonSetList_items_spec_template_spec_volumes_cephfs_user {doc 'user is optional: User is the rados user name, default is admin More info: https:_examplesk8sio/volumes/cephfs/READMEmd#how-to-use-it'}
															io_k8s_api_apps_v1_DaemonSetList_items_spec_template_spec_volumes_cinder {doc 'cinder represents a cinder volume attached and mounted on kubelets host machine Deprecated: Cinder is deprecated All operations for the in-tree cinder type are redirected to the cindercsiopenstackorg CSI driver More info: https:_examplesk8sio/mysql-cinder-pd/READMEmd'}
