							io_k8s_api_apps_v1_DaemonSetList_metadata_shardInfo {doc 'shardInfo is set when the list is a filtered subset of the full collection, as selected by a shard selector on the request It echoes back the selector so clients can verify which shard they received and merge sharded responses Clients should not cache sharded list responses as a full representation of the collectionThis is an alpha field and requires enabling the ShardedListAndWatch feature gate'}
