													io_k8s_api_apps_v1_ReplicaSet_spec_template_spec_volumes_flocker {doc 'flocker represents a Flocker volume attached to a kubelet_s host machine This depends on the Flocker control service being running Deprecated: Flocker is deprecated and the in-tree flocker type is no longer supported'}
