										optional
											io_k8s_api_authorization_v1_SelfSubjectAccessReviewSpec_resourceAttributes_labelSelector_requirements_values cardinality [1..*] {doc 'values is an array of string values If the operator is In or NotIn, the values array must be non-empty If the operator is Exists or DoesNotExist, the values array must be empty This array is replaced during a strategic merge patch'}
												mandatory
