									io_k8s_api_certificates_v1beta1_PodCertificateRequestList_items_metadata_managedFields cardinality [1..*] {doc 'ManagedFields maps workflow-id and version to the set of fields that are managed by that workflow This is mostly for internal housekeeping, and users typically shouldn_t need to set or understand this field A workflow can be the user_s name, a controller_s name, or the name of a specific apply path like ci-cd The set of fields is always in the version that the workflow used when modifying the object'}
