									io_k8s_api_certificates_v1beta1_PodCertificateRequestList_items_status_notBefore {doc 'notBefore is the time at which the certificate becomes valid  The value must be the same as the notBefore value in the leaf certificate in certificateChain  This field is set via the /status subresource  Once populated, it is immutable The signer must set this field at the same time it sets certificateChain'}
