				optional
					io_k8s_api_core_v1_NodeStatus_addresses cardinality [1..*] {doc 'List of addresses reachable to the node Queried from cloud provider, if available More info: https:_kubernetesio/docs/reference/node/node-status/#addresses Note: This field is declared as mergeable, but the merge key is not sufficiently unique, which can cause data corruption when it is merged Callers should instead use a full-replacement patch See https:_prk8sio/79391 for an example Consumers should assume that addresses can change during the lifetime of a Node However, there are some exceptions where this may not be possible, such as Pods that inherit a Node_s address in its own status or consumers of the downward API (statushostIP)'}
