													String io_k8s_api_core_v1_PodSpec_initContainers_env_valueFrom_fileKeyRef_key {doc 'The key within the env file An invalid key will prevent the pod from starting The keys defined within a source may consist of any printable ASCII characters except _=_ During Alpha stage of the EnvFiles feature gate, the key size is limited to 128 characters'}
