											io_k8s_api_core_v1_ReplicationControllerSpec_template_spec_volumes_storageos {doc 'storageOS represents a StorageOS volume attached and mounted on Kubernetes nodes Deprecated: StorageOS is deprecated and the in-tree storageos type is no longer supported'}
