									io_k8s_api_networking_v1_NetworkPolicyList_items_spec_podSelector {doc 'podSelector selects the pods to which this NetworkPolicy object applies The array of rules is applied to any pods selected by this field An empty selector matches all pods in the policy_s namespace Multiple network policies can select the same set of pods In this case, the ingress rules for each are combined additively This field is optional If it is not specified, it defaults to an empty selector'}
