						optional
							io_k8s_api_resource_v1_DeviceTaintRule_metadata_annotations cardinality [0..*] {doc 'Annotations is an unstructured key value map stored with a resource that may be set by external tools to store and retrieve arbitrary metadata They are not queryable and should be preserved when modifying objects More info: https:_kubernetesio/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/annotations'}
								optional
