									io_k8s_api_resource_v1beta2_DeviceClassList_items_metadata_creationTimestamp {doc 'CreationTimestamp is a timestamp representing the server time when this object was created It is not guaranteed to be set in happens-before order across separate operations Clients may not set this value It is represented in RFC3339 form and is in UTCPopulated by the system Read-only Null for lists More info: https:_gitk8sio/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventionsmd#metadata'}
