							String io_k8s_api_resource_v1beta2_ResourceClaimTemplate_metadata_name {doc 'Name must be unique within a namespace Is required when creating resources, although some resources may allow a client to request the generation of an appropriate name automatically Name is primarily intended for creation idempotence and configuration definition Cannot be updated More info: https:_kubernetesio/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-objects/names#names'}
