							io_k8s_api_resource_v1beta2_ResourceClaimTemplateList_items_spec {doc 'Describes the ResourceClaim that is to be generatedThis field is immutable A ResourceClaim will get created by the control plane for a Pod when needed and then not get updated anymore'}
								optional
