					String io_k8s_api_scheduling_v1beta1_PodGroup_apiVersion {doc 'APIVersion defines the versioned schema of this representation of an object Servers should convert recognized schemas to the latest internal value, and may reject unrecognized values More info: https:_gitk8sio/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventionsmd#resources'}
