			io_k8s_api_storage_v1_VolumeAttributesClass {doc 'VolumeAttributesClass represents a specification of mutable volume attributes defined by the CSI driver The class can be specified during dynamic provisioning of PersistentVolumeClaims, and changed in the PersistentVolumeClaim spec after provisioning'}
