							io_k8s_apiextensions_apiserver_pkg_apis_apiextensions_v1_JSONSchemaProps_oneOf_x_kubernetes_validations cardinality [1..*] {doc 'x-kubernetes-validations describes a list of validation rules written in the CEL expression language'}
